WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,400
Everyone, look at Jiang Yi

2
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:03,600
After steel training, I started to do plank support.

3
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:05,000
Very good attitude

4
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,200
Everyone cheers and disbands

5
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:11,580
Ten stars are waiting for me to stand up

6
00:00:11,580 --> 00:00:12,780
It looks good with you two

7
00:00:12,780 --> 00:00:16,460
This time, I am Lulu, the destroyer of the group.

8
00:00:16,460 --> 00:00:18,460
You performed very well just now

9
00:00:18,460 --> 00:00:19,660
I see your lightsaber

10
00:00:19,660 --> 00:00:21,850
I can actually track my target.

11
00:00:21,850 --> 00:00:24,280
I think what Ji Chuan said is right.

12
00:00:24,280 --> 00:00:26,680
I have always relied on his protection

13
00:00:26,680 --> 00:00:28,080
In fact, every time danger comes

14
00:00:28,080 --> 00:00:31,540
I haven't been able to help you at all.

15
00:00:31,540 --> 00:00:33,540
Thank you for the past few times, Lulu

16
00:00:33,540 --> 00:00:35,140
You are our main force

17
00:00:35,140 --> 00:00:38,190
But my abilities are indeed better than other members

18
00:00:38,190 --> 00:00:39,880
All must be strong

19
00:00:39,880 --> 00:00:42,280
It was clear that I had the ability to do it before

20
00:00:42,280 --> 00:00:43,480
But I just found myself today

21
00:00:43,480 --> 00:00:45,080
Can superpowers be used like this?
